# Terraform

Two GCP projects: `infra/health` and `infra/services`. One region, used consistently.

- Everything deployed is defined here. No console clicks, no gcloud scripts that mutate state.
- Cross-project IAM is limited to CI publishing to the health project's signal topic. Nothing broader.
- Name resources by purpose, not by product.
- Deployment is the LAST step of the build. Do not start here.
